OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FInitial low cloud and any hill
OL,6,Ffog will soon lift to leave a fine
OL,7,Fmorning and early afternoon with some
OL,8,Fsunshine. However, cloud thickening
OL,9,Ffrom the west through the afternoon
OL,10,Fwith rain arriving later. Breezy, but
OL,11,Ffeeling warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMuch of the evening and night
OL,14,Fwill be cloudy with some rain at
OL,15,Ftimes, this locally perhaps heavy.
OL,16,FRain starting to clear from the north
OL,17,Fby the morning. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
