OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FThe last of the overnight rain
OL,6,Fwill soon clear from southern areas,
OL,7,Fleaving a generally dry and bright,
OL,8,Fthough fresher feeling day on Friday.
OL,9,FStill pleasantly warm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,12,Fmostly fine day is expected on
OL,13,FSaturday with some sunshine. Turning
OL,14,Fwindy on Sunday with rain arriving
OL,15,Flater, this clearing by Monday to
OL,16,Fleave a day of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
